WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.606
A CTE is useful when one stage deserves a name It
can make

00:00:05.632 --> 00:00:11.177
a multi-step query easier to read It is especially
helpful when

00:00:11.191 --> 00:00:17.441
you need to calculate a window value first and
filter that result later Recursive

00:00:17.467 --> 00:00:23.054
queries also use the CTE structure Use a CTE because

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.633
it clarifies the logic not simply because the query
is long
